@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor User

node "Client device" {
  component "Web browser" as Browser
}

cloud "AWS deployment target (proposed)" {
  node "Web tier" {
    component "Next.js frontend" as FE
  }
  node "Application tier" {
    component "NestJS REST API" as API
    component "Authentication / RBAC" as AUTH
    component "Monitoring & alert logic" as MON
  }
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
  component "Optional scheduled worker" as WORKER
}

User --> Browser
Browser --> FE : HTTPS
FE --> API : HTTPS / JSON
API --> AUTH : validate identity and permissions
API --> DB : ORM queries
API --> MON : metrics / alerts
MON --> DB : read and write records
WORKER ..> DB : evaluate rules (if implemented)
WORKER ..> MON : trigger alerts (if implemented)

note bottom of FE
  Frontend: pages, forms, charts,
  loading/error/empty states
end note
note bottom of API
  DTO validation, guards,
  services, REST controllers,
  Swagger/OpenAPI
end note
note bottom of DB
  Private network access;
  secrets managed outside source control
end note
@enduml
